## StartStreaming
D geometry
H begin
D prepare rate=48000 cap=1[1] play=1[0]
H reserve playback allowed=ffffffffffffffff bw=308 -> ch=2
H reserve capture allowed=ffffffffffffffff bw=308 -> ch=3
